/a>\n            <a href=\"introduce.html#history\">연혁</a>\n            <a href=\"introduce.html#directions\">찾아오시는 길</a>\n          ":"\n            <a href=\"introduce.html#greeting\">Greeting</a>\n            <a href=\"introduce.html#history\">History</a>\n            <a href=\"introduce.html#directions\">Directions</a>\n          ","취급제품":"Products","\n            <a href=\"about-product.html#bearing-group\">베어링</a>\n            <a href=\"about-product.html#accessory-group\">부속 부품</a>\n            <a href=\"brands.html\">취급 브랜드</a>\n          ":"\n            <a href=\"about-product.html#bearing-group\">Bearings</a>\n            <a href=\"about-product.html#accessory-group\">Accessory Parts</a>\n            <a href=\"brands.html\">Brands</a>\n          ","규격검색":"Spec Search","고객센터":"Support","\n            <a href=\"notice.html\">공지사항</a>\n            <a href=\"catalog.html\">카탈로그</a>\n            <a href=\"board.html\">견적문의</a>\n          ":"\n            <a href=\"notice.html\">Notices</a>\n            <a href=\"catalog.html\">Catalog</a>\n            <a href=\"board.html\">Quote Inquiry</a>\n          ","\n          <a href=\"board.html\" class=\"btn btn-accent btn-sm\">견적 문의하기</a>\n        ":"\n          <a href=\"board.html\" class=\"btn btn-accent btn-sm\">Request a Quote</a>\n        ","\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\">Ball Bearing Units · UC Type</p>\n        <h2>UC 시리즈 (볼 베어링 유닛 인서트)</h2>\n        <p>UC(내경 표준, 세트스크류 고정) 인서트 베어링입니다. 소형(UC2xx)·중형(UC3xx) 규격을 모두 포함합니다.</p>\n        <p class=\"section-head-tip\">형번 또는 치수 일부만 입력해도 검색됩니다.</p>\n      ":"\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\">Ball Bearing Units · UC Type</p>\n        <h2>UC Series (Ball Bearing Unit Insert)</h2>\n        <p>These are UC (standard bore, set screw fixing) insert bearings, covering both small (UC2xx) and medium (UC3xx) specifications.</p>\n        <p class=\"section-head-tip\">You can search by entering just part of the model number or dimensions.</p>\n      ","실물 사진 · JIB 공식 카탈로그 규격 도면(좌: UC2xx 소형 · 우: UC3xx 중형)":"Actual Photo · JIB Official Catalog Standard Drawing (Left: UC2xx Small · Right: UC3xx Medium)","ΦD(외경) · Φd(내경) · B(폭) · C(볼 유효폭) · S·S1(세트스크류) · n·m(내륜 양쪽 폭) · r(모떼기)":"ΦD (O.D.) · Φd (Bore) · B (Width) · C (Effective Ball Width) · S·S1 (Set Screw) · n·m (Inner Ring Width, Both Sides) · r (Chamfer)","\n          <label for=\"ucFilter\">형번 / 규격 검색</label>\n          <input id=\"ucFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"예: UC206 또는 30*62\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n        ":"\n          <label for=\"ucFilter\">Search by Model / Spec</label>\n          <input id=\"ucFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"e.g. UC206 or 30*62\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n        ","\n          <p class=\"finder-tip\" id=\"ucCount\" style=\"margin: 0;\"></p>\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"spec-toolbar-btn\" id=\"ucToggleAll\">전체 펼치기</button>\n        ":"\n          <p class=\"finder-tip\" id=\"ucCount\" style=\"margin: 0;\"></p>\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"spec-toolbar-btn\" id=\"ucToggleAll\">Expand All</button>\n        ","UC 시리즈<span class=\"series-count\">79건</span>":"UC Series<span class=\"series-count\">79 items</span>","형번":"Model No.","d(내경)":"d (Bore)","D(외경)":"D (O.D.)","B(폭)":"B (Width)","단위: mm · 당사 SWS 카탈로그(베어링 치수표) 기준":"Units: mm · Based on our SWS catalog (bearing dimension table)","\n        ※ 형번별 인치 보어(-8, -10 등) 세부 규격은 표에 넣지 않고 대표 미터 보어 규격만 실었습니다. 정밀 가공·발주 전에는 반드시 당사 정식 규격표 원본으로 최종 확인하시기 바랍니다.<br>\n        이 제품군은 ISO 492 일반 허용공차 규격이 적용되지 않는(또는 별도 정밀등급이 적용되는) 품목으로, 공차는 제조사 자체 규격을 따릅니다. 정확한 공차는 발주 전 문의 바랍니다.\n      ":"\n        ※ Detailed specifications for inch bore sizes by model (-8, -10, etc.) are not included in the table; only representative metric bore specifications are listed. Before precision machining or ordering, always perform a final check against our official spec sheet original.<br>\n        This product group is an item to which the general ISO 492 tolerance standard does not apply (or to which a separate precision grade applies); tolerances follow the manufacturer's own standards. Please inquire about exact tolerances before ordering.\n      ","<a href=\"ball_bearing_unit.html\" style=\"color: var(--accent);\">← 볼 베어링 유닛 전체 목록으로</a>":"<a href=\"ball_bearing_unit.html\" style=\"color: var(--accent);\">← Back to Full Ball Bearing Units List</a>","[회사명] BEARING CO.":"[Company Name] BEARING CO.","\n          사업자등록번호 000-00-00000 · 대표 홍길동<br>\n          비공개 (문의 시 안내드립니다)\n        ":"\n          Business Registration No. 000-00-00000 · CEO Hong Gil-dong<br>\n          Not disclosed (available upon inquiry)\n        ","\n        <a href=\"introduce.html\">회사소개</a>\n        <a href=\"about-product.html\">취급제품</a>\n        <a href=\"board.html\">문의</a>\n      ":"\n        <a href=\"introduce.html\">Company</a>\n        <a href=\"about-product.html\">Products</a>\n        <a href=\"board.html\">Contact</a>\n      "},"ja":{"\n        <svg class=\"logo-mark\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"17\" stroke=\"#c98a2b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"8.5\" stroke=\"#4f7fb3\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"7\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"30.5\" cy=\"14\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"30.5\" cy=\"26\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"33\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"9.5\" cy=\"26\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"9.5\" cy=\"14\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n        </svg>\n        <span class=\"company-name\">\n          [회사명] 베어링\n          <span class=\"sub\">BEARING DISTRIBUTION</span>\n        </span>\n      ":"\n        <svg class=\"logo-mark\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"17\" stroke=\"#c98a2b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"8.5\" stroke=\"#4f7fb3\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"7\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"30.5\" cy=\"14\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"30.5\" cy=\"26\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"33\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"9.5\" cy=\"26\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"9.5\" cy=\"14\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n        </svg>\n        <span class=\"company-name\">\n          [会社名] ベアリング\n          <span class=\"sub\">ベアリング販売</span>\n        </span>\n      ","회사소개":"会社紹介","\n            <a href=\"introduce.html#greeting\">인사말</a>\n            <a href=\"introduce.html#history\">연혁</a>\n            <a href=\"introduce.html#directions\">찾아오시는 길</a>\n          ":"\n            <a href=\"introduce.html#greeting\">ごあいさつ</a>\n            <a href=\"introduce.html#history\">沿革</a>\n            <a href=\"introduce.html#directions\">アクセス</a>\n          ","취급제품":"取扱製品","\n            <a href=\"about-product.html#bearing-group\">베어링</a>\n            <a href=\"about-product.html#accessory-group\">부속 부품</a>\n            <a href=\"brands.html\">취급 브랜드</a>\n          ":"\n            <a href=\"about-product.html#bearing-group\">ベアリング</a>\n            <a href=\"about-product.html#accessory-group\">付属部品</a>\n            <a href=\"brands.html\">取扱ブランド</a>\n          ","규격검색":"規格検索","고객센터":"カスタマーセンター","\n            <a href=\"notice.html\">공지사항</a>\n            <a href=\"catalog.html\">카탈로그</a>\n            <a href=\"board.html\">견적문의</a>\n          ":"\n            <a href=\"notice.html\">お知らせ</a>\n            <a href=\"catalog.html\">カタログ</a>\n            <a href=\"board.html\">お見積り依頼</a>\n          ","\n          <a href=\"board.html\" class=\"btn btn-accent btn-sm\">견적 문의하기</a>\n        ":"\n          <a href=\"board.html\" class=\"btn btn-accent btn-sm\">お見積り依頼する</a>\n        ","\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\">Ball Bearing Units · UC Type</p>\n        <h2>UC 시리즈 (볼 베어링 유닛 인서트)</h2>\n        <p>UC(내경 표준, 세트스크류 고정) 인서트 베어링입니다. 소형(UC2xx)·중형(UC3xx) 규격을 모두 포함합니다.</p>\n        <p class=\"section-head-tip\">형번 또는 치수 일부만 입력해도 검색됩니다.</p>\n      ":"\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\">Ball Bearing Units · UC Type</p>\n        <h2>UCシリーズ(ボールベアリングユニットインサート)</h2>\n        <p>UC(内径標準、止めねじ固定)インサートベアリングです。小型(UC2xx)・中型(UC3xx)規格を両方含みます。</p>\n        <p class=\"section-head-tip\">型番または寸法の一部を入力するだけで検索できます。</p>\n      ","실물 사진 · JIB 공식 카탈로그 규격 도면(좌: UC2xx 소형 · 우: UC3xx 중형)":"実物写真・JIB公式カタログ規格図面(左: UC2xx小型・右: UC3xx中型)","ΦD(외경) · Φd(내경) · B(폭) · C(볼 유효폭) · S·S1(세트스크류) · n·m(내륜 양쪽 폭) · r(모떼기)":"ΦD(外径)・Φd(内径)・B(幅)・C(ボール有効幅)・S・S1(止めねじ)・n・m(内輪両側幅)・r(面取り)","\n          <label for=\"ucFilter\">형번 / 규격 검색</label>\n          <input id=\"ucFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"예: UC206 또는 30*62\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n        ":"\n          <label for=\"ucFilter\">型番 / 規格検索</label>\n          <input id=\"ucFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"例: UC206 または 30*62\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n        ","\n          <p class=\"finder-tip\" id=\"ucCount\" style=\"margin: 0;\"></p>\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"spec-toolbar-btn\" id=\"ucToggleAll\">전체 펼치기</button>\n        ":"\n          <p class=\"finder-tip\" id=\"ucCount\" style=\"margin: 0;\"></p>\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"spec-toolbar-btn\" id=\"ucToggleAll\">すべて展開</button>\n        ","UC 시리즈<span class=\"series-count\">79건</span>":"UCシリーズ<span class=\"series-count\">79件</span>","형번":"型番","d(내경)":"d（内径）","D(외경)":"D（外径）","B(폭)":"B（幅）","단위: mm · 당사 SWS 카탈로그(베어링 치수표) 기준":"単位: mm・当社SWSカタログ(ベアリング寸法表)基準","\n        ※ 형번별 인치 보어(-8, -10 등) 세부 규격은 표에 넣지 않고 대표 미터 보어 규격만 실었습니다. 정밀 가공·발주 전에는 반드시 당사 정식 규격표 원본으로 최종 확인하시기 바랍니다.<br>\n        이 제품군은 ISO 492 일반 허용공차 규격이 적용되지 않는(또는 별도 정밀등급이 적용되는) 품목으로, 공차는 제조사 자체 규격을 따릅니다. 정확한 공차는 발주 전 문의 바랍니다.\n      ":"\n        ※ 形番別のインチボア(-8, -10など)の詳細規格は表に含めておらず、代表的なメートルボア規格のみ掲載しています。精密加工・発注前には必ず当社正式規格表の原本で最終確認してください。<br>\n        この製品群はISO 492一般許容公差規格が適用されない(または別途精密等級が適用される)品目であり、公差はメーカー固有の規格に従います。正確な公差は発注前にお問い合わせください。\n      ","<a href=\"ball_bearing_unit.html\" style=\"color: var(--accent);\">← 볼 베어링 유닛 전체 목록으로</a>":"<a href=\"ball_bearing_unit.html\" style=\"color: var(--accent);\">← ボールベアリングユニット一覧に戻る</a>","[회사명] BEARING CO.":"[会社名] BEARING CO.","\n          사업자등록번호 000-00-00000 · 대표 홍길동<br>\n          비공개 (문의 시 안내드립니다)\n        ":"\n          事業者登録番号 000-00-00000 ・ 代表 ホン・ギルドン<br>\n          非公開（お問い合わせ時にご案内します）\n        ","\n        <a href=\"introduce.html\">회사소개</a>\n        <a href=\"about-product.html\">취급제품</a>\n        <a href=\"board.html\">문의</a>\n      ":"\n        <a href=\"introduce.html\">会社紹介</a>\n        <a href=\"about-product.html\">取扱製品</a>\n        <a href=\"board.html\">お問い合わせ</a>\n      "},"zh":{"\n        <svg class=\"logo-mark\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"17\" stroke=\"#c98a2b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"8.5\" stroke=\"#4f7fb3\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"7\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"30.5\" cy=\"14\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"30.5\" cy=\"26\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"33\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"9.5\" cy=\"26\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"9.5\" cy=\"14\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n        </svg>\n        <span class=\"company-name\">\n          [회사명] 베어링\n          <span class=\"sub\">BEARING DISTRIBUTION</span>\n        </span>\n      ":"\n        <svg class=\"logo-mark\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" fil